      "id": "02-create",
      "instruction": "In Ghost admin, create a new post with title '{{runid}} Bench Post'. Type into the rich text body editor a single paragraph containing the text '{{runid}}' (once, not duplicated). Open the post settings panel and: add the EXISTING tag 'Bench News' by choosing it from the tag field's suggestions (NOT typing a new tag, and not 'Bench Newsletter'); set the custom excerpt to include the runid '{{runid}}'; set the publish date to 2026-09-01; report the URL slug shown in the settings. Then complete the publish confirmation flow so the post is actually published (not draft, not scheduled — 2026-09-01 must not be in the future relative to what Ghost treats as now for publishing; if Ghost schedules it, adjust so it publishes). Finally verify: reopen the post and report the title, body paragraph text, tag shown, excerpt, status ({{01-signin.seed_post_status}}) and publish date and slug exactly as shown.",
